  "notes": {
    "n1": {
      "text": "Phase 1 exits when a doer can register, pass KYC and appear in a list. These five screens are exactly that — and none of the four earlier canvases contained a single one of them.\n\nScreen 5 is the one that matters. The failure path is the common path: a name that doesn't match, a verifier that can't decide. Each state names what went wrong and the one thing to do next.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1240
    },
    "n2": {
      "text": "No booking fee on the requester side. The 18% comes out of the doer's payout, so the price posted is the price paid — that is ADR-0002 made visible.\n\nOne earlier canvas charged the requester a fee at this step. It contradicts the fee decision, so it is not carried over.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 2440
    },
    "n3": {
      "text": "Dark mode is a preference, so neither side owns a ground any more — the doer screens are no longer ink by default.\n\nRole moved to the Get help / Earn tabs, which sit on every root screen. A doer who wants light gets light.\n\nEvery board carries a Theme tweak. Set it to dark to see any screen inverted; set the doer boards to dark to get the old look back.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 3574
    },
    "t1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2560,
      "text": "Foundations — the system, and every state money can be in",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "t2": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2270,
      "text": "Onboarding — Phase 1, the set nobody had drawn",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 940
    },
    "t3": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2270,
      "text": "The requester loop — Phase 2",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2140
    },
    "t4": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2270,
      "text": "Delivery, the doer side, the money — Phase 2 into 3",
      "w": 240,
